kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "yaml-dsl-observability-boundary"
purpose: "将 observability 配置从 YAML 主线移除，迁移到 Python/CLI runtime entrypoints，并在迁移期内提供可执行的迁移警告。 [scope-review-2026-07-13-c25-xlsx-ir-path-presence]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r121,YAML mainline MUST NOT treat `observability.*` as authoring surface,"主线 YAML MUST 不再把 `observability.*` 作为稳定 authoring surface: - demand / workflow schema MUST 从主线 YAML 中移除 `observability.*` - 主线 parser / validator MUST 不再把 observability 视为业务建模字段"
  r363,"known legacy observability keys MUST fail-fast with migration hints","系统 MUST 对已知 legacy YAML observability.* key 执行 fail-fast（不得再 warning 后忽略继续运行）: - 错误信息 MUST 明确 observability 已从 YAML 主线移除 - 错误信息 MUST 指向 Python / CLI runtime entrypoint 的迁移路径 - 普通未知字段 MUST 继续按现有 unknown-field 规则处理,不得一律当作 observability 处理"
  r484,observability integration MUST be owned by runtime entrypoints,"可观测性集成 MUST 由 Python / CLI runtime entrypoints 承载: - runtime entrypoints MUST 能承载自定义 hooks / observers / viz 配置 - YAML 主线 MUST 不再重复建模这些 integration surfaces"
  r565,"docs, skills, notebooks and examples MUST migrate away from YAML observability a","仓库内面向用户的材料 MUST 不再把 YAML `observability.*` 作为推荐写法: - docs MUST 以 runtime entrypoints 作为 SSOT - skills / notebooks / examples MUST 同步迁移"
scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r121,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r121,"new-yaml-authoring-does-not-include-observability-blocks","",用户编写新的 demand 或 workflow YAML,`observability.*` MUST NOT 作为推荐或受支持的主线路径出现,true
  r363,"legacy-observability-key-fails-fast",某个旧 YAML 仍包含已知的 observability.logging 或等价 key,用户执行 validate 或运行入口解析,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并给出迁移到 Python/CLI runtime entrypoints 的提示",true
  r484,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r484,"custom-observer-is-attached-without-yaml-observability-confi","",用户需要挂接自定义 hook、observer 或内部观测工具,系统 MUST 通过 Python / CLI runtime entrypoints 完成装配,true
  r565,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r565,"user-facing-materials-no-longer-teach-yaml-observability-blo","",用户阅读仓库中的 YAML DSL 文档、skills 或 notebooks,这些材料 MUST 不再把 `observability.*` 作为主线 authoring 示例,true